{"ts": "2026-05-17T00:06:49.919Z", "source": "greeting-cron", "greetingType": "morning", "cronJobId": "8c9ef393-9ba0-45f8-856f-be13e23fd483", "dashboardSessionKey": "agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_229011826b88e09badbbb6f43ad38ba3", "dashboardTextSource": "file", "dashboardText": "早上好，sola。\n该起床了，今天也别急着一下子冲出去。\n先喝点水，让脑子慢慢醒过来。\n早餐别只随便应付，多少吃点热的。\n哼，周日的清晨还算安静，我就陪你把这一天开个好头。\n务必完完整整地回来，听见了吗？", "textFile": "/Users/sola/Desktop/kscc/Qwen3-TTS/eula_emotion_revelation/关心温柔/morning_20260517_0800.txt", "audioFile": "/Users/sola/Desktop/kscc/Qwen3-TTS/eula_emotion_revelation/关心温柔/morning_20260517_0800.ogg", "feishuOpenId": "ou_229011826b88e09badbbb6f43ad38ba3", "feishuMessageId": "om_x100b6fa427547d30b18c003de9eea42", "fileKey": "file_v3_0011p_3cd2a979-37b1-400b-833e-fe87946b7cbg", "duration": 17447}
{"ts": "2026-05-17T04:01:52.936Z", "source": "greeting-cron", "greetingType": "noon", "dashboardSessionKey": "agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_229011826b88e09badbbb6f43ad38ba3", "dashboardTextSource": "file", "dashboardText": "中午好，sola。\n\n先把手里的事放一放，去吃点东西。\n\n别又想着随便糊弄过去……我会记住的。\n\n下午若是困了，就靠一会儿，慢慢来。\n\n我在这里陪你收拾节奏，不许一个人硬撑。", "textFile": "/Users/sola/Desktop/kscc/Qwen3-TTS/eula_emotion_revelation/关心温柔/noon_20260517_1200.txt", "audioFile": "/Users/sola/Desktop/kscc/Qwen3-TTS/eula_emotion_revelation/关心温柔/noon_20260517_1200.ogg", "feishuOpenId": "ou_229011826b88e09badbbb6f43ad38ba3", "feishuMessageId": "om_x100b6fa795c7f4a4b27dd5b70b18d38", "fileKey": "file_v3_0011p_99f1ff9a-2950-4cb0-bc7e-02910425d0cg", "duration": 14607}
